    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d701">

                <pb facs="0803" n="793" xml:id="pg793"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 MPC/88</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Yugoslav Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Fotitch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 648</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-10-08">October 8,
                        1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary</hi>: On behalf of the Royal Yugoslav
                    Government I have the honor to present the request that Yugoslavia be given a
                    seat in the Mediterranean Commission. Yugoslavia, on account of her geographic
                    position, is interested in all problems pertaining to the Mediterranean Zone
                    which will be dealt with by this Commission, and her ceaseless fighting against
                    the common enemy for more than two and one-half years warrants her request to be
                    represented in the said Commission.</p>
                <p>I venture to hope that Your Excellency will be good enough to take the necessary
                    steps with the American Government that this request of the Yugoslav Government
                    will receive satisfaction. A similar request has been presented by the Yugoslav
                    Government to the Governments of Great Britain and the Union of the Soviet
                    Socialist Republics.</p>
                <p>Please accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Const.</hi>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fotitch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
